'''Imagawa Yoshimoto''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Sengoku Wargods Vajiras (Gacha Event)|Sengoku Wargods Vajiras]] gacha event, and was added in [[Version 6.1 Update|Version 6.1]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.5 Update|Version 7.5]] increases health, range and Weaken duration. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]] and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]].

