==Trivia==
*[[wikipedia:Imagawa Yoshimoto|Imagawa Yoshimoto]] was one of the three daimyōs that dominated the Tōkaidō region throughout the Sengoku period in Japan. He was eventually killed by [[Oda Nobunaga (Uber Rare Cat)|Oda Nobunaga]] in 1560. He was also allies with [[Takeda Shingen (Uber Rare Cat)|Takeda]] [[wikipedia:Takeda Shingen|Shingen]], another Wargod.
*[[wikipedia:Imagawa Yoshimoto|Imagawa Yoshimoto]] and [[Trickster Himeyuri (Uber Rare Cat)|Trickster Himeyuri]] are the only Cats who mention the mythical Kitsune Fox (Ninetails), which could imply a connection of the two based on their descriptions.
*The hair comb at the top is the emblem for the Imagawa clan. He is the only Wargod to possess his clan's emblem.
*He is the first unit to recieve a resistance instead of a full immunity from his [[Ultra Talents]].

